Package: ads-gamepad-service
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: Beckhoff USA Community
Homepage: https://github.com/Beckhoff-USA-Community/ADS-Gamepad-Service
Description: Bridges gamepads to TwinCAT PLCs over ADS
 Reads a wired PlayStation 5 DualSense controller and serves its state to
 TwinCAT PLCs over ADS on port 25733. Runs as a systemd service under its
 own service account. Settings live in
 /opt/ads-gamepad-service/appsettings.json and survive upgrades.
